cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: "If you use spaclone, please cite it as below. Please also cite the packages you use through spaclone: they are listed under references, and docs/citing.md says which function uses which."
title: spaclone
type: software
abstract: Is spatial immune-receptor data spatial? Calibrated location-trust tests and clonal concentration maps for spatial BCR/TCR data, with readers, receptor QC, the transcriptome, B-cell receptor biology and repertoire statistics, and bridges to established single-cell repertoire packages.
